    ("CODING_LSP_ENABLED", "Tools / code-exec / cron / approvals", "OFF (not safe-local)", "I-2 / H1 (dedup decision D2): after a successful `str_replace`/`apply_patch`/`create_file`, run an external checker (`pyright --outputjson` for `.py`, `tsc --noEmit -p <nearest tsconfig.json>` keeping only this file's errors, or — with no tsconfig — `tsc --noEmit <file>` for `.t…", "advanced"),
    ("CODING_SNAPSHOT_ENABLED", "Tools / code-exec / cron / approvals", "OFF (not safe-local)", "I-4 / H2 (dedup decision D3): shadow-git PER-FILE snapshot/restore. Before each mutating coding action (`str_replace`/`apply_patch`/`move_file`/`delete_file`, and `create_file` only when overwriting an existing file), commit the SINGLE touched file into a shadow git repo under t…", "advanced"),
    ("GIT_TOOLS_ENABLED", "Tools / code-exec / cron / approvals", "OFF (**ON under POLYROB_LOCAL**)", "Register the `git` tool (status/diff/log/branch/checkout/add/commit/pull/push/clone) over the confined workspace.", "advanced"),
