    ("GROUP_DEFAULT_MODE", "Identity / polyrob / local profile", "`mention`", "the default `chat.mode` for a room with no per-chat overlay. ADDRESSED = an @mention (or `text_mention`/`/cmd@bot`), a reply to one of the agent's own messages, or a `chat.wake_words` hit. `mention` = answer an ADDRESSED line from anyone — the owner is not exempt; `active` = ans…", "public"),
    ("GROUP_REQUIRE_MENTION", "Identity / polyrob / local profile", "ON", "Alias, one release. This flag was replaced this gate with `chat.mode`: `false` now means `GROUP_DEFAULT_MODE=active` (answer every message in an allowlisted room) and is resolved inside `ChatPolicy.defaults()`; an explicit `GROUP_DEFAULT_MODE` wins over it. Nothing else reads th…", "internal"),
